menu "Auto Gauge application profile"
    config AG_SOFTWARE_BENCH
        bool "Run volatile software bench (simulated CAN/display/storage)"
        default n
        help
            Explicit development simulation. No GPIO, physical flash storage,
            CAN bus, BLE, panel, touch, OTA selection or SDK mark-valid calls.
            The default firmware remains blocked until a qualified board profile
            is supplied. This is not a profile for either user's unknown ESP32.
    config AG_NATIVE_PROFILE
        bool "Link unified native adapters with a locally supplied board profile"
        default n
        depends on !AG_SOFTWARE_BENCH
        help
            Links partition/reset/boot/TWAI/NimBLE/OTA adapters in one image.
            The weak board-profile getter returns NULL unless overridden by a
            trusted local board definition. A NULL profile activates nothing.
            Native build defaults supply secure NimBLE and development OTA map;
            no GPIO, credentials, trust keys or production health is invented.
endmenu
